pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% The same formula and the same binary, proved SATISFIABLE. `x1=0 x2=0 x3=1 x4=0` satisfies all
% three constraints:
%   1 x1 1 x2 >= 0    ->  0 + 0 >= 0   ok
%   1 x3 1 x4 >= 1    ->  1 + 0 >= 1   ok
%   1 ~x3 1 ~x4 >= 1  ->  0 + 1 >= 1   ok
f 3;
sol ~x1 ~x2 x3 ~x4;
output NONE;
conclusion SAT;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
